{"pages":[{"h":792,"ocr":false,"w":612,"segs":[["SOULARIUM TRAINING VIDEOS 1",43.841199999999994,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,634.72489999999993,9,false],["SOULARIUM",150.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,366.5,116.00059999999996,80,false],["TRAINING VIDEOS",150.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,464.17999999999995,176.00059999999996,80,false],["HOW TO BEST USE THE VIDEOS",150.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,439.25999999999999,194.10059999999999,20,false],["After you listen to the other person answer, share with",369.20000000000005,224.88939999999991,574.53500000000008,237.29139999999995,9,false],["them one thing in their story that connected with your",369.20000000000005,237.88939999999991,574.6880000000001,250.29139999999995,9,false],["own.",369.20000000000005,250.88939999999991,387.52400000000006,263.29139999999995,9,false],["Write down the sample way to “introduce Soularium.”",369.20000000000005,276.88939999999991,573.23659999999995,289.30039999999997,9,false],["Rewrite it, if needed, to reflect how you talk, and",369.20000000000005,289.88939999999997,551.14400000000012,302.29139999999995,9,false],["practice saying it aloud.",369.20000000000005,302.88939999999997,458.99300000000005,315.29139999999995,9,false],["(Hint: You can find much of this in the printed",369.20000000000005,328.88939999999997,542.98100000000022,341.29139999999995,9,false],["Soularium instruction cards as well.)",369.20000000000005,341.88939999999997,509.65330000000006,354.30039999999997,9,false],["GETTING STARTED",145.40000000000001,356.91469999999998,226.24000000000001,377.4547,20,false],["1. WATCH VIDEO 1",145.40000000000001,387.00969999999995,201.44,402.41469999999998,15,false],["Watch Video 1: “Soularium: Getting Started” with a",145.40000000000001,402.52969999999999,338.92700000000013,414.93169999999998,9,false],["friend, mentor or small group.",145.40000000000001,415.52969999999999,258.71900000000005,427.93169999999998,9,false],["http:\/\/crupress.campuscrusadeforchrist.com\/green\/",145.40000000000001,428.52969999999999,345.35299999999995,440.93169999999998,9,false],["index.php\/video\/tag\/soularium",145.40000000000001,441.52969999999999,265.60400000000004,453.93169999999998,9,false],["4. SHARE",369.20000000000005,378.36939999999993,399.24500000000006,393.77439999999996,15,false],["Who else needs to watch this video?",369.20000000000005,393.88940000000002,504.92900000000009,406.29140000000001,9,false],["2. ASK AND DISCUSS",145.40000000000001,478.00969999999995,213.60500000000002,493.41469999999998,15,false],["How do you know when you’re genuinely listening to",145.40000000000001,493.52969999999999,344.43500000000017,505.93169999999998,9,false],["another person?",145.40000000000001,506.52969999999999,207.25700000000001,518.93169999999998,9,false],["GOING DEEPER",369.20000000000005,426.27440000000001,434.94000000000005,446.81440000000003,20,false],["1. WATCH VIDEO 2",369.20000000000005,456.36940000000004,426.75500000000005,471.77440000000001,15,false],["Watch Video 2: “Soularium: Going Deeper” with a",369.20000000000005,471.88940000000002,557.06600000000014,484.29140000000001,9,false],["friend, mentor or small group.",369.20000000000005,484.88940000000002,482.51900000000006,497.29140000000001,9,false],["http:\/\/crupress.campuscrusadeforchrist.com\/green\/",369.20000000000005,497.88940000000002,569.15300000000002,510.29140000000001,9,false],["index.php\/video\/tag\/soularium",369.20000000000005,510.88940000000002,489.40400000000005,523.29140000000007,9,false],["The creators of Soularium said: “It’s not about getting",145.40000000000001,532.52969999999993,347.82690000000002,544.94069999999999,9,false],["to a certain destination, it’s about finding connections",145.40000000000001,545.52970000000005,349.18700000000013,557.93169999999998,9,false],["in your story that can lead to deeper dialogue.”",145.40000000000001,558.52970000000005,319.95500000000004,570.93169999999998,9,false],["How would thinking this way shape how you use",145.40000000000001,571.52970000000005,328.505,583.93169999999998,9,false],["Soularium?",145.40000000000001,584.52969999999993,189.72429999999997,596.94069999999999,9,false],["2. ASK AND DISCUSS",369.20000000000005,547.36940000000004,437.40500000000003,562.77440000000001,15,false],["What’s been your biggest challenge in continuing",369.20000000000005,562.88940000000002,554.95100000000014,575.29139999999995,9,false],["the conversation\/transitioning to deeper spiritual",369.20000000000005,575.88940000000002,558.69500000000016,588.29139999999995,9,false],["conversations after you’ve done the Soularium",369.20000000000005,588.88940000000002,545.17570000000001,601.30039999999997,9,false],["questions?",369.20000000000005,601.88940000000002,410.37500000000006,614.29139999999995,9,false],["(If you’ve used Soularium before, how have you",145.40000000000001,610.52970000000005,323.31979999999999,622.94069999999999,9,false],["have been more focused on arriving at a specific",145.40000000000001,623.52970000000005,325.99400000000003,635.93169999999998,9,false],["“destination” rather than on genuinely listening? How",145.40000000000001,636.52970000000005,350.86100000000005,648.93169999999998,9,false],["could that change?)",145.40000000000001,649.52970000000005,219.51500000000001,661.93169999999998,9,false],["How can we be mindful that God is already at work in",369.20000000000005,627.88940000000002,570.62900000000013,640.29139999999995,9,false],["another person’s story, especially during a Soularium",369.20000000000005,640.88940000000002,570.07780000000002,653.30039999999997,9,false],["conversation?",369.20000000000005,653.88940000000002,422.81300000000005,666.29139999999995,9,false],["3. PRACTICE",145.40000000000001,686.00969999999995,186.035,701.41470000000004,15,false],["Do Soularium on yourself. Answer the 5 questions",145.40000000000001,701.52970000000005,334.75010000000003,713.94069999999999,9,false],["with a friend or mentor.",145.40000000000001,714.52970000000005,235.31,726.93169999999998,9,false],["“Prayer, listening, and preparation are key ingredients",369.20000000000005,679.88940000000002,573.78800000000012,692.29139999999995,9,false],["to taking a conversation deeper.” Which of these do",369.20000000000005,692.88940000000002,562.3130000000001,705.29139999999995,9,false],["you find the most challenging?",369.20000000000005,705.88940000000002,484.88600000000008,718.29139999999995,9,false]]},{"ocr":false,"w":612,"h":792,"segs":[["Have you already done any of the preparation steps",146.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,339.22500000000014,45.836899999999901,9,false],["they suggest? Which one(s)? (I.e. Do Soularium",146.40000000000001,46.434899999999857,328.6302,58.845899999999915,9,false],["on yourself. Choose 1-3 images that tell the story of",146.40000000000001,59.434899999999857,338.90100000000012,71.836899999999901,9,false],["your faith journey to Christ. Choose 1-4 images that",146.40000000000001,72.434899999999857,341.92500000000013,84.836899999999901,9,false],["express the essence of the gospel story.)",146.40000000000001,85.434899999999857,296.24099999999999,97.836899999999901,9,false],["Write down the sample transition questions they",146.40000000000001,111.43489999999986,331.72800000000012,123.8368999999999,9,false],["suggest. (Hint: you’ll find them in the printed",146.40000000000001,124.43489999999986,315.90600000000012,136.8368999999999,9,false],["Soularium instruction cards too.) Which one do you",146.40000000000001,137.43489999999986,342.6803000000001,149.84589999999992,9,false],["want to memorize and try?",146.40000000000001,150.43489999999986,247.97399999999999,162.8368999999999,9,false],["3. SET A DEADLINE",146.40000000000001,186.91489999999999,207.60000000000002,202.31989999999996,15,false],["Pick a date by which you agree to have completed the",146.40000000000001,202.43489999999986,346.25400000000013,214.8368999999999,9,false],["3 preparation steps and to meet back together to share",146.40000000000001,215.43489999999986,351.33900000000006,227.8368999999999,9,false],["what you’ve come up with.",146.40000000000001,228.43489999999986,246.28200000000004,240.8368999999999,9,false],["4. PRACTICE",146.40000000000001,264.91489999999999,186.87,280.31989999999996,15,false],["Take turns sharing your faith journey story and",146.40000000000001,280.43489999999997,325.2120000000001,292.83689999999996,9,false],["the gospel with the images you’ve chosen. Practice",146.40000000000001,293.43489999999997,336.68700000000013,305.83689999999996,9,false],["on each other using one of the “continuing the",146.40000000000001,306.43489999999997,320.19900000000007,318.83689999999996,9,false],["conversation” transition questions.",146.40000000000001,319.43489999999997,280.31100000000004,331.83689999999996,9,false],["Is there any helpful feedback you can give each other?",146.40000000000001,345.43489999999997,349.35900000000015,357.83689999999996,9,false],["5. SHARE",146.40000000000001,381.91489999999999,176.61000000000001,397.31989999999996,15,false],["Who else needs to watch this video?",146.40000000000001,397.43489999999997,282.12900000000002,409.83689999999996,9,false],["SOULARIUM TRAINING VIDEOS 2",43.841199999999994,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,635.51689999999996,9,false]]}]}